{'symbol': 'MGM', 'date': '2022-08-03 18:22:00', 'title': 'MGM CHINA REPORTS 2022 FIRST HALF RESULTS', 'text': 'TO PARTICIPATE IN PUBLIC TENDER OF MACAU GAMING CONCESSION FULL CONFIDENCE IN MACAU FUTURE DEVELOPMENT HONG KONG , AUG. 3, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MGM CHINA HOLDINGS LIMITED ("MGM CHINA" OR THE "COMPANY"; SEHK STOCK CODE: 2282) TODAY ANNOUNCED SELECTED UNAUDITED FINANCIAL DATA OF THE COMPANY AND ITS SUBSIDIARIES (THE "GROUP") FOR THE SECOND QUARTER AND THE FIRST HALF OF 2022. MACAU AND GREATER CHINA ARE UNDER THE ADVERSE IMPACT OF THE COVID-19 PANDEMIC IN 2022.'}